            <ArticleTitle>[Na K-dependent ATPase activity of synaptosomes of rat cerebral hemispheres with ischemic necrosis of the myocardium, occurring after emotional-painful stress].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>61-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Within 2 days after ligation of the descending branch of left coronary artery activity of Na, K-dependent ATPase was inhibited in heavy synaptosomal fraction of brain hemispheres of rats. Emotional-painful stress, which developed before simulation of acute occlusion of coronary artery, prevented the enzyme inhibition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
